msgstr "UART 映射"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:56
#: dce700cdb10145a287c9274e16d4c9e7
msgid ""
"The UARTs are marked Rn and Tn in the above pinouts. The Rn pin is the "
"receive pin for UARTn. The Tn pin is the transmit pin for UARTn."
msgstr "上述引脚图中 UART 标记为 Rn 和 Tn。Rn 引脚为 UARTn 的接收引脚，Tn 引脚为 UARTn 的发送引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:59
#: 8e7419558a8f4283b78a91315c4eeac7
msgid ""
"The pin labeled Rx on each corner of the board is a common pin for ESC "
"telemetry input."
msgstr "板子四角标注为 Rx 的引脚是 ESC 数传输入的公共引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:62
#: fbbaebd81e4f4eb9bab5b5a12e117a6d
msgid "SERIAL0 -> USB"
msgstr "SERIAL0 -> USB"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:63
#: 80b03382a8a04a82a6f6b5b69d95b7e2
msgid "SERIAL1 -> USART1 (TX only for Frsky Telem, no ext inverter needed)"
msgstr "SERIAL1 -> USART1（仅 TX 用于 FrSky 遥测，无需外部反相器）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:64
#: 75221d923d8c46d39cda4291efbb7909
msgid "SERIAL3 -> USART3 (RC Input protocols by default. PPM not supported.)"
msgstr "SERIAL3 -> USART3（默认 RC 输入协议，不支持 PPM。）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:65
#: 8ba2f3e759104079955e7eac23557231
msgid "SERIAL4 -> UART4 (GPS/Telem1)"
msgstr "SERIAL4 -> UART4（GPS/Telem1）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:66
#: 8c0833b3e0254eb7b9fdd58525caa73d
msgid "SERIAL5 -> UART5 (RX only, ESC Telemetry protocol by default)"
msgstr "SERIAL5 -> UART5（仅 RX，默认 ESC 数传协议）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:67
#: 13d60d720e2f4ba9810708f23306cb06
msgid "SERIAL6 -> USART6 (GPS2/Telem2)"
msgstr "SERIAL6 -> USART6（GPS2/Telem2）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:70
#: fcfd1a4051954f73aa6fafaeb07aeb85
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:72
#: f50a1278ab244b6b94c373df17af86fb
msgid ""
"RC input is configured on the R3 (UART3_RX) pin. It supports all RC "
"protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for details for a "
"specific RC system. :ref:`SERIAL3_PROTOCOL<SERIAL3_PROTOCOL>` is set to "
"\"23\", by default, to enable this."
msgstr ""
"RC 输入配置在 R3（UART3_RX）引脚上。支持除 PPM 以外的所有 RC 协议。有关特定 RC 系统的详细信息，请参见 "
":ref:`common-rc-systems`。:ref:`SERIAL3_PROTOCOL<SERIAL3_PROTOCOL>` "
"默认设为「23」以启用此功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:74
#: c651cae157f94183a54faa635ba5e09f
msgid "SBUS/DSM/SRXL connects to the R6 pin."
msgstr "SBUS/DSM/SRXL 连接到 R6 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:76
#: df2754975f0440ef90c6744d28813623
msgid ""
"SBUS FPort requires connection to T3 and an external bi-directional "
"inverter, see :ref:`common-FPort-receivers`."
msgstr "SBUS FPort 需要连接到 T3 并使用外部双向反相器，请参见 :ref:`common-FPort-receivers`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:78
#: 1b57712003ee4206af5481447d1fb40a
msgid ""
"CRSF also requires a T3 connection, in addition to R6, and automatically "
"provides telemetry."
msgstr "CRSF 除需要 R6 外还需要 T3 连接，并自动提供数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:80
#: 6c440aba0ba047308fac9df9e9ee012e
msgid ""
"SRXL2 requires a connection to R3 and T3 and automatically provides "
"telemetry.  Set :ref:`SERIAL3_OPTIONS<SERIAL3_OPTIONS>` to \"4\"."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2 需要连接到 R3 和 T3，并自动提供数传。设置 :ref:`SERIAL3_OPTIONS<SERIAL3_OPTIONS>` 为「4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:82
#: 8e45a9cb2a344635a3bb8b18e229eb83
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"在 ArduPilot 中，任何 UART 都可用于 RC 系统连接，并兼容除 PPM 外的所有协议。详情请参阅 :ref:`common-rc-"
"systems`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:85
#: 75a43388155d432e99f9a574bb0c7baa
msgid "ESC Telemetry"
msgstr "ESC 数传"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:87
#: 454aa09df7f14f68acfc7d7a4a6e1c3b
msgid ""
"The SERIAL5 port (UART5) is for ESC telemetry. It is connected through the "
"motor connector and works out of the box with the `Tekko32 F3 Mini "
"<https://shop.holybro.com/tekko32-f3-4in1-45a-mini-esc_p1132.html>`__ which "
"is commonly paired with this autopilot."
msgstr ""
"SERIAL5 端口（UART5）用于 ESC 数传。它通过电机连接器连接，与 `Tekko32 F3 Mini "
"<https://shop.holybro.com/tekko32-f3-4in1-45a-mini-esc_p1132.html>`__ 开箱即用，该"
" ESC 常与此飞控配套使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:90
#: 08da2203be5d4a15af67e04bc2d637b2
msgid "FrSky Telemetry"
msgstr "FrSky 数传"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:92
#: e1cec7626b7444298b345972ca84d395
msgid ""
"FrSky Telemetry is supported using the SmartPort pad (UART1). You need to "
"set the following parameters to enable support for FrSky S.PORT. It has "
"built-in inverters and a diode to allow for operation from a single pin with"
" no special adapters."
msgstr ""
"FrSky 数传通过 SmartPort 焊盘（UART1）支持。需要设置以下参数以启用对 FrSky S.PORT "
"的支持。内置反相器和二极管，允许从单引脚操作，无需特殊适配器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:97
#: f4590dee88bd4e189fe00f3c31701541
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` 4 or 10"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` 4 或 10"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:98
#: 80ef490bedd04896bc867ac0d5357040
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` 0"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` 0"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:101
#: 2afc4d65bf65483db37d20a439b3a908
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:103
#: 3bf9d73373a74eadb5d5fd667c2a343b
msgid ""
"The KakuteF4 supports OSD using :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` 1 (MAX7456 "
"driver)."
msgstr "KakuteF4 支持使用 :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` 1（MAX7456 驱动）的 OSD。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:106
#: e136de0becb34c3dae783384b3dc8c20
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:108
#: 87253dafce9441efa6b4f23608b8875c
msgid ""
"The KakuteF4 supports up to 5 PWM outputs. The pads for motor output M1 to "
"M6 on the above diagram are for the 5 outputs. M1-4 outputs support DShot "
"and :ref:`Bi-Directional DShot<bidir-dshot>`, as well as all PWM types. The "
"M5 is defaulted to support serial LEDs instead of PWM but can be changed by "
"changing its default function using :ref:`SERVO5_FUNCTION<SERVO5_FUNCTION>` "
"and supports Dshot."
msgstr ""
"KakuteF4 最多支持 5 路 PWM 输出。上图中电机输出 M1 到 M6 的焊盘对应 5 路输出。M1-4 输出支持 DShot 和 "
":ref:`双向 DShot<bidir-dshot>`，以及所有 PWM 类型。M5 默认支持串行 LED 而非 PWM，但可通过更改 "
":ref:`SERVO5_FUNCTION<SERVO5_FUNCTION>` 默认功能来修改，支持 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:112
#: 84c0a850e13a41ae9f6bd0c1a0ef3070
msgid "The PWM is in 2 groups:"
msgstr "PWM 分为 2 组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:114
#: f45cb90e8cc643a39c97cb4730b21283
msgid "PWM 1 and 2 in group 1"
msgstr "PWM 1 和 2 为第 1 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:115
#: 50985220a0044a469fa0a30f7dd60d69
msgid "PWM 3 and 4 in group 2"
msgstr "PWM 3 和 4 为第 2 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:116
#: fc091534b1954e36b0840ab971954a5b
msgid "PWM 5 in group 3 (defaulted as serial LED)"
msgstr "PWM 5 为第 3 组（默认为串行 LED）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:118
#: 4932e5bd868e4473bb20fa09df16de80
msgid ""
"Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate, whether PWM"
" or Dshot. If any channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the "
"group need to use DShot."
msgstr ""
"同一组内的通道无论使用 PWM 还是 DShot 都必须使用相同的输出频率。若组内任一通道使用 DShot，则该组所有通道均需使用 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:123
#: a5f2472e2ec8453dbccebabc7e5e5de5
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr "电池监测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:125
#: 5f35e3195db446d8ba91eff8abcfb922
msgid ""
"The board has a built-in voltage and current sensor. The voltage sensor can "
"handle up to 6S LiPo batteries."
msgstr "此板内置电压和电流传感器。电压传感器最多支持 6S LiPo 电池。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:128
#: 64d67f6cb61c48cbb21862ccf7e6232a
msgid "The correct battery setting parameters are:"
msgstr "正确的电池设置参数为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:130
#: e326d62a770b4995904dec1af7a8694b
msgid ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` 4"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` 4"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:131
#: e32d1111eee94a29b2450a10bef96016
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 13"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 13"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:132
#: 3361e093e3dd4cb7b0aba25abdb70f28
msgid ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 12"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 12"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:133
#: 90fa77ec7a2043d3832724afdc87a86f
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 10.9"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 10.9"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:134
#: 9f85b43c628d4dbe9be161b71dcae69e
msgid ":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 28.5"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 28.5"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:137
#: cca1b6f149d24d5f81468bbd6c536add
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:139
#: e573347a5de54d109295afcf58d63194
msgid ""
"The KakuteF4 Mini does not have a built-in compass, but you can attach an "
"external compass using I2C on the SDA and SCL pads."
msgstr "KakuteF4 Mini 没有内置罗盘，但可以通过 SDA 和 SCL 焊盘上的 I2C 连接外部罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:142
#: 02a45aea06ab45e9b4a17bac0a96d8cf
msgid "Logging"
msgstr "日志记录"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:144
#: acbe6c56853647b4bc5002caabdf8e55
msgid ""
"The KakuteF4 supports on-board data flash logging. Use "
":ref:`LOG_BACKEND_TYPE<LOG_BACKEND_TYPE>` = 2)"
msgstr ""
"KakuteF4 支持板载数据闪存日志记录。使用 :ref:`LOG_BACKEND_TYPE<LOG_BACKEND_TYPE>` = 2）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:147
#: 0c6e52f96b6a44e7bd5da5dcd72f1572
msgid "Firmware"
msgstr "固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:149
#: 1c8d07401ab443efa68ff96506d48e5b
msgid ""
"Firmware for this board can be found `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ in  sub-folders labeled \"KakuteF4Mini\"."
msgstr ""
"此板的固件可在 `此处 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ 找到，位于标注为「KakuteF4Mini」的子文件夹中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:153
#: 5487362ac77947708c0ea0ff0381f11e
msgid "Loading ArduPilot onto the board"
msgstr "将 ArduPilot 加载到板上"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:155
#: d8b1188504bb49c9af1c5f3331957f4b
msgid ""
"Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the "
"bootloader button pressed. Then you should load the \"with_bl.hex\" "
"firmware, using your favourite DFU loading tool. See :ref:`common-loading-"
"firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards`"
msgstr ""
"初始固件加载可通过 DFU 完成，按住引导程序按钮的同时插入 USB。然后使用您喜欢的 DFU 加载工具加载「with_bl.hex」固件。请参见 "
":ref:`common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:159
#: 08b27cd9de194d22a5ed81b04cb4d167
msgid ""
"Once the initial firmware is loaded you can update the firmware using any "
"ArduPilot ground station software. Updates should be done with the "
"KakuteF4Mini firmware files. See :ref:`common-loading-firmware-onto-"
"pixhawk`."
msgstr ""
"初始固件加载完成后，可使用任何 ArduPilot 地面站软件更新固件。更新应使用 KakuteF4Mini 固件文件。请参见 "
":ref:`common-loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk`。"
